msgid ""
"Enter the API ID issued by the SenseCAP portal (Organization/Security "
"Credentials)."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez l'ID API émis par le portail SenseCAP "
"(Organisation/Identifiants de sécurité)."

#: inputs/sensecap_weather.py:147
